          info        : "Failure to restrict system access to authenticated users negatively impacts SLEM 5 security."
          solution    : "Note: If a graphical user interface is not installed, this requirement is not applicable.

Configure SLEM 5 GUI to not allow unattended or automatic logon to the system.

Add or modify the following lines in the \"/etc/sysconfig/displaymanager\" file:

DISPLAYMANAGER_AUTOLOGIN=\"\"
DISPLAYMANAGER_PASSWORD_LESS_LOGIN=\"no\""
